# G1: the AUDITED arm of the GDN pair slice (QWEN_FAST_GDN_PAIR_SLICE). c2-packed-tp4-gate-pairslice is c2-packed-tp4-gate (both verify audits ON) plus QWEN_FAST_GDN_PAIR_SLICE=1 and
# QWEN_FAST_TP4_VGLUE_AUDIT=1 and nothing else. The packed GDN block's odd users (1 and 3) take their 16-row slice from ONE row-major conversion of the 64-row projection (to_layout /
# slice / to_layout, ttnn's own three ops in Slice) instead of one whole-projection untilize each. Beside every such slice the layer also makes ttnn's own slice and tp4_vglue.audit_round
# compares the two bit for bit on every chip after the replay (every GDN layer on round 1, two per round after) and fails a layer whose 'pair slice user k' entries are missing.
# The smoke runs four concurrent coding users (warmup, one stream, four 4k prompts, four 32k prompts): the odd users only exist at four (and two or three) live users.
# Read: no '[PINDIAG] tp4 vglue audit mismatch' line; '[PINDIAG] tp4 vglue audit N exact=True layers=... entries=K' lines; '[PINDIAG] tp4 pair slice engaged site=gdn_slice' once and no
# 'pair slice fell back' or 'pair slice idle' line (idle means V2 was on or no half-tile slice reached it); every user's text equal to the same user alone (the smoke's policy).
# A FAIL means the shared conversion is not byte-exact: SKIP GT1-GT4. Duration (estimate): 60-120 min.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/gluefix window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/gluefix and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gluefix-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for ONE FRESH tag (never used before) that B0 builds from the pushed tp4/gluefix commit while production
# serves; the driver substitutes it in every template. A reused tag is skipped by the build step and would silently serve an old image.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gluefix-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-gate-pairslice
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4_code_equal,concurrent4_code_32k
